### Submit Adoption Form Data
POST http://localhost:4000/forms/adoption
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "formData": {
    "nameOfDog": "Buddy",
    "firstName": "John",
    "lastName": "Doe",
    "phone": "123-456-7890",
    "email": "john.doe@example.com",
    "signature": "John Doe",
    "date": "2023-12-01"
  }
}

### Submit Inquiry Form Data
POST http://localhost:4000/forms/inquiry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "formData": {
    "fullName": "Jane Doe",
    "email": "jane.doe@example.com",
    "dogName": "Flower",
    "message": "Hello, I would love to meet Flower!"
  }
}